    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mo>[</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>]</mo><mo>-</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mo>&#177;</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>:</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mi>tan</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>tan</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>. If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow></munder><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>&#952;</mi></math>, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mi>S</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is equal to"
  },
